#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixPilot-C3.rst:12
#: fe63b26d50974344a3767bfa861ebd5f
msgid "The PixPilot-C3 is a low cost flight controller with fully redundant IMUs. In most cases, an onboard compass is more susceptible to interference, so we removed the onboard compass and used an external compass instead. Integrated high gain buzzer. The PixPilot-C3 flight controller is sold by a range of resellers listed on the makeflyeasy(http://www.makeflyeasy.com)"
msgstr ""

